    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark editorial system, disciplined cyan/red/yellow semantics, and a clear ROI focal point. However, the desktop hero is visually unbalanced by excessive empty space and awkward headline wrapping; mobile compresses ledger labels and figures into cramped columns with very small supporting text. The tablet/mobile header also reads as clipped navigation rather than fully polished responsive composition, with subdued labels and incomplete contrast evidence.",
